and you might feel frustrated, but you may have made the wrong decision.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tDo you think there's something wrong with me? I can't seem to find the right girl. It's really distressing.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn8le08ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:\t\tThe situation might look hopeless now, but there must be something you can do! I thought you had started going out to comic book stores before you met that girl. What happened? It sounded like a good idea.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tIt was, at first. Then I realized that the only girl who had gone there recently was Camilla.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:\t\tOh, I heard she has a boyfriend now. You must have been quite upset about that.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tThanks, Sally. You always know what to say to make situations worse!", "id": 2, "time": "24000", "image": "engenn8le08ob10re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:\t\tDon't sound so despondent! Things will change, you'll see.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tWell, I might just throw in the towel. What's the point anyway?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:\t\tHmm ... it sounds like you need some help. Let me take you for a drink. Maybe that could help you change your outlook on this. I had thought about going to the mall before you called me, but I think I'll go another day.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tThanks, Sally.", "id": 3, "time": "50100", "image": "engenn8le08ob10re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le08ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le08ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}